### CarePoint Admin Accounts Phase 12 - Data Quality checks
### Replace {{API_BASE_URL}} and {{ADMIN_TOKEN}} before running.

@API_BASE_URL = http://localhost:4000
@ADMIN_TOKEN = paste-admin-access-token-here

### Get data-quality report
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/api/admin/users/data-quality
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Export data-quality issues as CSV
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/api/admin/users/data-quality/export
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Existing governance summary for comparison
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/api/admin/users/governance-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### Existing credential review queue for comparison
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/api/admin/users/credential-review-tasks?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN}}
